program	errors/unsafe_mem_bad_use.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	the intent marker of `UnsafeMemory` must be `Device` or `Normal`, got `Foo`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: the intent marker of `UnsafeMemory` must be `Device` or `Normal`, got `Foo`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/unsafe_mem_bad_use.saw:7:1"
log	"    |"
log	" 7 | static DEV: UnsafeMemory<Int, Foo> = UnsafeMemory(0x40000000)"
log	"    | ^"
log	"   hint: `Device` = volatile register block; `Normal` = plain RAM region"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
